---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator invokes transferInvestorPosition(from, to)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_from: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_from --> q_revert_from: positions[from] does not exist
    q_revert_from --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_check_from --> q_check_to: positions[from] exists
    q_check_to --> q_revert_to: positions[to] already exists
    q_revert_to --> [*]: revert PositionExists
    q_check_to --> q_transfer: positions[to] is empty
    q_transfer --> q_cleanup: positions[to] = positions[from]
    q_cleanup --> [*]: delete positions[from]; emit PositionTransferred(from, to)

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: Position transfer is operator-only for compliance (e.g. wallet migration)
        INV-002: Target address must not already have a position
        INV-003: Source position is deleted after transfer
    end note
